Purpose
-------
Capture the initial `delay_tsc` entry RIP and the poll-loop RDTSC RIP in the
same run, then associate retained poll samples with entry invocations using
the TSC start value and register context. This checks whether sparse poll
samples can be assigned to a particular call; it does not count every poll
instruction per call.

